Output blastfall-terminal.gif
Set Width 120
Set Height 40
Set FontSize 17
Set Padding 18
Set TypingSpeed 24ms
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Framerate 60

Type "echo 'Blastfall: real npm dependency graph in HydraDB.'"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "echo 'Every version, publish date, maintainer. Exposure as traversal -- not similarity search.'"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "bash scripts/video/demo_query.sh ms@2.1.3"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "echo 'A vector index cannot answer this at all.'"
Enter
Sleep 3s
